{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S05把重点从尊严与怀念的冲突转向是否允许自己回忆快乐、是否不必为难自己，弱化了尊严一端与怀念一端的直接拉扯。\",\n    \"S08只写回忆亲近时光带来的温暖，没有像X一样明确表现他不愿把这份温暖当作回头的理由，尊严立场因此暂时退出了这一轮变化。\",\n    \"S09把矛盾简化为舍不得旧生活还是需要有人陪伴，删去了害怕回去后再次忍受委屈这一重要的尊严维度。\",\n    \"S13更突出未来孤单和缺少亲近之人的担忧，略微把对旧日生活及归属的怀念收窄成对陪伴的需求。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更持续地让两端同时发挥作用：想念曾被当作自己人的生活，会重新唤起对委屈和自我尊严的坚持；坚持不再忍让，又会加深对失去亲近与归属的难受。Y也保留了两端，但部分段落转向了回忆能否带来安慰、是否允许自己怀念或未来是否孤单，因而减弱了两端交织拉扯的程度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4aab7761-0f97-42c3-90ae-33598782a069", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T093929998811Z", "elapsed_seconds": 20.36, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:39:50.369097+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18f713ab15d291d773382a85c46ee55d68d99cb61188f03075cc8608a1cb11f0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f68